url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":15,"created_at":"2025-07-02T16:33:37Z","updated_at":"2025-08-03T16:27:33Z","closed_at":"2025-08-03T16:27:31Z","assignee":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.5.beta2, 4.5.beta1\nNot reproducible in 4.5.dev5 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta2 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7680) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13500HX (20 threads) - 15.72 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have a SoftBody3D with its vertices pinned to the bones of a Skeleton3D that is animated with SkeletonModifier3D. After the changes introduced in #106863, SoftBody lags behind the Skeleton when it is animated. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff0ee2c1-1445-4547-b915-0ef91dbe86ce)\n\nOccasionally, when new animation is played by the AnimationPlayer, SoftBody jumps to the skeleton pose set by the AnimationPlayer instead of the override that should be enforced by the SkeletonModifier, causing a transient but noticeable visual glitch. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed25fb1b-1fea-4366-8c22-c29585fa2a6a)\n\nThis issue appears regardless of whether `physics_interpolation` is enabled or not and it seems to be a race condition caused by the transition from `frame_pre_draw` signal to `NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS` and `NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS`, which results in SoftBody being updated before `_process_modification()` is resolved.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the MRP. The Skeleton will be animated by SkeletonModifier to play the looped \"Flap\" animation. Notice the gap between the SoftBody and wing bones. You can pause with F9 to examine it up close.\nTap _Space_ several times until a visual glitch appears: for a moment, SoftBody's mesh will jump towards the center, then back. \n\nPressing _Space_ resets the AnimationPlayer, which plays an animation with folded wings. It is expected that this animation shouldn't be seen as it is normally overriden by _process_modificaton(), but because of the issue this doesn't always happen.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[softbody-skeletonmodifier.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21021899/softbody-skeletonmodifier.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108209/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}